# Ignore file for data.Dockerfile only; BuildKit picks it up by name, which
# keeps it out of the cache directory that serves as the build context.
#
# Deny everything, then re-admit exactly the cache NPZs. The cache directory is
# a working directory on someone's machine and picks up editor scratch files,
# .DS_Store and stray scripts; none of that belongs in a byte-pinned image.
*
!*_features.npz
